  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Public Financial Management and Revenue Administration in Indonesia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;SUPPORT THE GOVERNMENT OF INDONESIA TO ENHANCE THE PUBLIC SECTOR contribution to the socio-economic development of its population. It is being established to support the Government&apos;s medium-term public financial management reform agenda and to complement Indonesia&apos;s Government Financial Management and Revenue Administration Program. It intends to strengthen capacity, efficiency, governance and transparency in public resource mobilization, management and oversight. The purpose of Phase II of the Trust Fund is to provide continued support to the Republic of Indonesia in its public financial management reform agenda as reflected in the Medium Term Strategy Note approved by the Policy and Advisory Committee (PAC) of the
 Trust Fund in 2012. The objective of the Program is to improve efficiency, governance, integrity and transparency of Indonesia&apos;s public financial management.&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
